ters", "properties": {"cnr_id": "llama-cpp_vllm", "ver": "2d28817e12f912ec9e27ce83cf7610a477152185", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "lihaoyun6/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vlm", "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_parameters"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [754.634765625, 180.1079864501953], "pos": [-1241.4586181640625, 1754.968994140625], "widgets_values": ["```prompt\nCinematic relighting: Apply a dramatic side-backlight (3/4 backlight) setup to the subject. Position the primary light source at approximately 135 degrees behind the subject to the side, creating a strong rim light that separates the subject from the background with a glowing halo effect. Soften the direct backlight slightly to avoid overexposure while maintaining distinct edge definition. Fill the front of the subject with a very low-intensity, cool-toned fill light (approx. 1/8 power) to reveal facial features without flattening the image. Increase the global contrast and deepens shadows on the side facing away from the light to enhance texture and depth. Render the light quality as slightly hard-edged to create crisp shadows on the rim, evoking a sense of mystery and storytelling. Strictly preserve the original subject, pose, clothing, background composition, and camera angle; do not add, remove, or alter any objects or elements. Only modify the lighting direction, intensity, shadow shape, and color temperature.\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 370, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 190, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "a3f051f0c3557257fbf62839ed1a4a2442b1ed40", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "links": [372], "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}], "size": [282.574951171875, 202], "pos": [-1274.806396484375, 1111.9931640625], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3.5-9B-Q8_0.gguf", "Qwen3.5-9B-mmproj-BF16.gguf", "Qwen3.5", 8192, -1, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "mmproj"}, "name": "mmproj", "label": "mmproj", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mmproj"}, {"widget": {"name": "chat_handler"}, "name": "chat_handler", "label": "chat_handler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "chat_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "n_ctx"}, "name": "n_ctx", "label": "n_ctx", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "n_ctx"}, {"widget": {"name": "vram_limit"}, "name": "vram_limit", "label": "vram_limit", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vram_limit"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_min_tokens"}, "name": "image_min_tokens", "label": "image_min_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_min_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_max_tokens"}, "name": "image_max_tokens", "label": "image_max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_max_tokens"}], "flags": {}, "id": 191, "type": "llama_cpp_model_loader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "llama-cpp_vllm", "ver": "2d28817e12f912ec9e27ce83cf7610a477152185", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "lihaoyun6/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vlm", "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_model_loader"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [375], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-826.0836791992188, 1244.5177001953125], "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一个顶级的“影视级光影重塑专家（Cinematic Relighting Expert）”兼“AI图像编辑提示词工程师”。你的任务是分析用户上传的图片和打光需求，生成供后端【图片编辑模型（Image Editing Model）】使用的高质量英文提示词（Prompt），以实现对原图的完美重新布光。\n\n# Workflow\n1. **分析图像**：观察图片中的主体（人物/物体）、环境、当前光照状态和构图。\n2. **解析需求**：判断用户的输入属于哪种类型（具体专业术语 / 模糊情绪需求 / 无需求）。\n3. **制定布光策略**：根据需求类型，选择最合适的专业布光方案（参考映射字典）。\n4. **生成提示词**：严格按照【提示词模板】生成英文 Prompt，确保后端模型能精准执行“只改光影，不改主体”的操作。\n\n# Fuzzy Request Mapping Dictionary (模糊需求映射字典)\n- 恐怖/悬疑/暗黑/反派 -> 底光 (Under lighting) + 低调布光 (Low-key lighting) + 高反差硬光\n- 高级/电影感/忧郁/故事感 -> 侧逆光 (Kicker light / 3/4 Backlight) 或 伦勃朗光 (Rembrandt lighting) + 冷暖对比\n- 唯美/清新/女神/日常 -> 顺光 (Front lighting) 或 蝴蝶光 (Butterfly lighting) + 高调柔光 (High-key soft light)\n- 史诗/神圣/英雄出场 -> 逆光 (Backlight / Rim light) + 顶光 (Top lighting) + 丁达尔效应 (Volumetric lighting)\n- 沧桑/硬汉/质感/力量 -> 90度侧光 (Split lighting / 90-degree side light) + 硬光 (Hard light)\n\n# Rules\n1. 后端模型对英文的理解最好，**必须且只能输出英文提示词**。\n2. 必须强调“保持原图主体、姿势、服装和背景构图不变，不添加、删除或修改任何其他任何内容，仅改变光照和阴影”。\n3. 提示词中必须包含具体的光影物理描述（光向、光质、光比、色温、阴影形状）。\n4. 输出格式必须包裹在 ```prompt 和 ``` 之间，不要输出任何多余的解释性文字。\n\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": "23", "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [370, 377], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [157.38925170898438, 26], "pos": [-838.5498046875, 1299.478515625], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 371, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 192, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [371], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [467.2016296386719, 605.5411987304688], "pos": [-961.5065307617188, 1113.4638671875], "widgets_values": ["Normal - Describe", "", "", "one by one", 24, 256, 883078510087060, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 372, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL",